{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"昂扬退潮后，又忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\"source\":\"S03-B3：这股活动感也可以听成一次短暂的侧身离场……那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装；只是它没有替心里的事找到答案。S03-B5：也可以听成……前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮……仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把侧身离场和昂扬退潮作为两种可并存的听法呈现，屏幕稿用“后”将两种听法串成了先后发生的过程。\"},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"我也想相信自己当初没走错\",\"source\":\"那一步走得对不对，后不后悔？没走的话，如今又会怎样？\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是对当初的选择提出疑问，屏幕稿额外加入了希望证明自己没走错的心理倾向。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其限定为一种有条件的心理听法，屏幕稿去掉条件和“仿佛”，把可能的解读变成了确定的表达。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b3fd79e-2b88-4cbd-828a-43e0c34e05da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T191047292793Z", "elapsed_seconds": 170.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T19:13:37.793493+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "40735a55652c56fab821038f09667e5c7c67c97cf2093d52d0f09aa6b3e70118", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "